<title>ISRAEL: Israel Chemicals Q2 net 79.5 mln shekels.</title>
<headline>Israel Chemicals Q2 net 79.5 mln shekels.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel Chemicals Ltd.</p>
<p>			   (In thousands of shekels)</p>
<p>			 Q2 96     Q2 95	6-MTH 96    6-MTH 95</p>
<p>Revenue		1,323,162 1,079,055  2,645,723   2,168,553</p>
<p>Operating profit     136,047    75,367    258,911     157,841</p>
<p>Net profit (loss)     79,476  (103,582)   125,535     (70,831)</p>
<p>Israel Chemicals is Israel's largest chemicals concern. The government owns 48.5 percent of the company while the Eisenberg Group and Israel Corp own 25 percent.</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
